  "description": "Ten years ago, Seul-Ha was the popular campus \"It Girl\" and Do-Seok was the college loser-- until she accidentally ruined his life. Today, their roles are completely inverted: Seul-Ha is an exhausted workplace loner, and Do-Seok has returned as her gorgeous, unstoppable team leader. Do-Seok is back with one goal: to complete some unfinished business. Can Seul-Ha survive his cold authority, or will her past finally catch up to her?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
